      "id": "a2.situations.practice-airport-check-in",
      "level": "A2",
      "topics": ["situations"],
      "title": "At the check-in desk",
      "text": "Agent: Good morning. Where are you flying today? Lucía: To Madrid. Here's my passport. Agent: Thank you. Are you checking any bags? Lucía: Yes, I'd like to check one bag. This small one is my carry-on. Agent: OK. Would you like a window seat or an aisle seat? Lucía: An aisle seat, please. Agent: Here's your boarding pass. Your flight leaves from gate 21 at 10:40. Boarding starts at 10:10. Lucía: Thanks a lot!",
      "source": { "kind": "original" }
    }
  ],
